Package: OptSampling
Type: Package
Title: Optimization of Fixed-Size Sampling Designs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Pedro", "Garcia-Segador", email = "pgsegador@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yves", "Tille", role = "aut"))
Author: Pedro Garcia-Segador [aut, cre], Yves Tille [aut]
Maintainer: Pedro Garcia-Segador <pgsegador@gmail.com>
Description: Optimize systematic sampling orderings by variable neighborhood
    search for balance, spatial spreading and squared estimation error.
    Construct conditional optimal sampling designs by revised simplex with
    exact or heuristic column pricing. Inclusion probabilities are prescribed.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, Matrix, methods, stats, graphics, utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: sampling, TSP, WaveSampling
SystemRequirements: C++11
NeedsCompilation: yes
